==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
The Imperator Saels and Sir Seals can be dealt with using high-range units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. If you have [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]]

==='''Chapters 2 & 3'''===
There are more threatening enemies in this stage, like Angelic Gory and Gabriel, so tankers like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] are recommended alongside midrangers and backliners. [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] and/or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe]] are useful for clearing the peons.

